  "claim_boundary": "This lock preserves January and February 2020 preliminary total housing-starts SAAR headline levels from two official archived Census/HUD NRC PDFs knowable before the decision time. The 32,000-unit difference compares those two release-time headline levels; it is not the official month-over-month change, which uses a revised prior-month estimate. The lock excludes the April 16 March event, the later February revision, official sampling intervals as range inputs, projects, builders, properties, a probability distribution, forecast, calibrated interval, pandemic or policy causality, recommendation, execution, investment performance, external review, deployment, and user impact.",
